  "details": "Description\n\nWhenever I log into vrchat with my pc, my avatars don't load in. Instead, I'm left the error avatar. Even my fallback avatars aren't loading in.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLog into vrchat on your pc, wait for your avatar to load in and watch it go to the error avatar, then try loading in another avatar just for that avatar to go to the error avatar.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Oculus, headset: Oculus Link Quest 2)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
